  "body": "Discover contemporary living at Lot 32, 55 Rimurehia Rise, Stanmore Bay — a brand-new home offering a relaxed coastal lifestyle in a thoughtfully designed community. Perfectly positioned in the heart of Stanmore Bay, this home combines modern comfort, quality finishes, and convenient access to beaches, schools, shopping, and transport links.\r\n\r\nFeaturing a well-designed layout with three bedrooms, including 2 master suites and 3 bathrooms, this home provides comfortable living for families, professionals, or those seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle. The open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area create a welcoming space for everyday living, while the private deck and easy-care garden provide the perfect setting to relax and entertain.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n• Brand-new home in a sought-after coastal community\r\n• 3 bedrooms, including 2 master suites\r\n• 3 bathrooms\r\n• Open-plan kitchen with quality appliances and practical layout\r\n• Spacious open-plan living and dining area\r\n• Private deck\r\n• Designed for modern, easy-care living\r\n\r\nCommunity Amenities:\r\nResidents can enjoy a fantastic range of shared facilities within the development, including:\r\n• Community Hall\r\n• Tennis Court\r\n• Children’s playground\r\n• Multi-purpose sports court\r\n• BBQ and outdoor recreation area\r\n• Scenic walking paths throughout the development\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n• Approximately 7 minutes to Silverdale Shopping Centre\r\n• Approximately 10 minutes to the future Penlink connection, providing improved access to Albany and Auckland CBD\r\n• Close to beautiful beaches, all within approximately 10 minutes’ drive\r\n\r\nNearby Education Options:\r\n• Red Beach School\r\n• Stanmore Bay School\r\n• Wentworth Primary School\r\n• Wentworth College\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity to secure a brand-new home in a growing coastal community, offering modern design, fantastic shared amenities, and an enviable Stanmore Bay location.\r\n\r\nEnquiries over $880,000.\r\n\r\nCall us today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nDirections: Google Maps may not yet show 55 Rimurehia Rise. Please navigate to Melia Place, Stanmore Bay, where directional signs will guide you to the property.",
